    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Inspired by <i>Alchemy Deluxe,\u00a0</i>WildRise reinvents tile-matching with deeper strategic mechanics. As a forest guardian, you'll carefully place tiles to restore lifeless concrete biomes, where every move cascades across the board and wrong choices can block your path to victory.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Key Features:</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Strategic tile-matching</strong> \u2014 Familiar mechanics, reimagined with depth and creativity</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Reclaim the wild</strong> \u2014 Restore forests, rivers, wetlands, volcanoes, and ancient ruins</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Bring back life</strong> \u2014 Watch birds, butterflies, and wildlife return as nature spreads</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Evolving challenge</strong> \u2014 Easy to learn mechanics that demand strategic mastery</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Complete experience</strong> \u2014 24 handcrafted levels, Impossible Mode, and Steam Achievements</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Stunning biomes</strong> \u2014 Each environment offers unique restoration challenges</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Everyone thinks they understand WildRise after the first few levels. The forest has other plans.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Help the world grow green again \u2014 one beautiful tile at a time.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3225790/extras/92a26a057f9dccbd041f21344250d685.avif?t=1754322531\" width=800 height=933 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Inspired by <i>Alchemy Deluxe,\u00a0</i>WildRise reinvents tile-matching with deeper strategic mechanics. As a forest guardian, you'll carefully place tiles to restore lifeless concrete biomes, where every move cascades across the board and wrong choices can block your path to victory.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Key Features:</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Strategic tile-matching</strong> \u2014 Familiar mechanics, reimagined with depth and creativity</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Reclaim the wild</strong> \u2014 Restore forests, rivers, wetlands, volcanoes, and ancient ruins</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Bring back life</strong> \u2014 Watch birds, butterflies, and wildlife return as nature spreads</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Evolving challenge</strong> \u2014 Easy to learn mechanics that demand strategic mastery</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Complete experience</strong> \u2014 24 handcrafted levels, Impossible Mode, and Steam Achievements</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Stunning biomes</strong> \u2014 Each environment offers unique restoration challenges</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Everyone thinks they understand WildRise after the first few levels. The forest has other plans.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Help the world grow green again \u2014 one beautiful tile at a time.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3225790/extras/92a26a057f9dccbd041f21344250d685.avif?t=1754322531\" width=800 height=933 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
